{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107536","id":2592681420,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6aiS3M","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107536","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107536.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107536.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107536","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107536/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107536/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107536/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/be0c68845e449e54149273f8f09f98cfa4e4f63b","number":107536,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix miscellaneous oddities around the class reference (part 6)","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Continuation of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107143\r\n\r\nThis PR addressed yet yet another huge chunk of class reference oddities I remembered to note down for later while localizing the class reference. Some of these are clear typos, some are inconsistencies, some are just awkward.\r\n\r\nOf particular note:\r\n- Standardize the description for `language` everywhere\r\n\t-  \"_Language code used for line-breaking and text shaping algorithms_ [...]\" and similar\r\n- Replace a very nasty \"_The color's `a`lpha channel_\" pun\r\n- Reword **EditorSetting**'s `network/connection/network_mode` to be somewhat less awkward\r\n- Reword the following for clarity:\r\n\t- **Window**'s `move_to_center`\r\n\t- **Sprite2D**'s `is_pixel_opaque`\r\n\t- **StreamPeer**'s `get_data` and `get_double`\r\n\t- **TabBar**'s `tab_close_pressed`\r\n\t- **PortableCompressedTexture2D**'s `keep_compressed_buffer`\r\n- Shifted **VoxelGI**'s `size` description around\r\n- Mention **CanvasItem** in the deprecated warnings of the `oversampling` properties\r\n- Remove redundant \"_deprecated_\" from some descriptions\r\n\t- There is no point stating this in the description itself. The deprecation warning is already enough\r\n- Reword **GeometryInstance3D**'s `cast_shadow` to be more meaningful\r\n- Remove \"_0 = off [...]_\" from **ProjectSetting**'s `xr/openxr/foveation_level`\r\n\t- We genuinely don't do this anywhere, and it's not particularly polished\r\n- Removed \"_user signals_\" from **Script**'s `get_script_signal_list`\r\n\t- This is hugely misleading, because \"**user** signals\" are separate and created through [`add_user_signal`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_object.html#class-object-method-add-user-signal)\r\n- Add `[code]` tags to **TextServer**'s `string_to_upper` & similar\r\n\t- For consistency with the corresponding **String** methods\r\n- Add link to [RFC 645 specifications](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6455) to a few of **WebSocketPeer**'s descriptions\r\n- Replace a few occurrences of \"timely\" and \"forward renderer\" with more common alternatives\r\n- Fix missing word in all array's `get` methods\r\n- Fix typo in **Control**'s leading description\r\n\t- This has been so long-standing, I am not sure if I should actually fix it, because it **will** invalidate localizations really badly\r\n- Fix **DisplayServer**'s `screen_get_pixel` claiming it returns a whole screenshot and literally the entire [Color] type\r\n- Fix missed standardization of `horizontal_alignment` properties, leading to duplicate translation strings\r\n- Fix \"parameters\" being referred as \"arguments\" in a few places\r\n- Fix some missing articles on the way\r\n\r\n\r\nFor some of the descriptions affected, additional tweaks have been made to justify a whole translation string change.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/use